      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d66ca7a8b321b92cc47d89d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼此来一场最棒的对决吧、拉拉！\n而且……我会赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4f1281bc2eebeea5d0edda09baaad66da744d2852f2dbc91377b36b88678f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4821314940ba97c7de1c2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在夕阳映照下的教室里彼此立下誓言。\n向着决战，时间开始加速――",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4d688724a204c794c7a5aaa11e4248fd995234ac49034bfe5a0d7a71785d8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df307588725c12babcf87e33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，即便为了证明自身的强大，\n也没必要勉强去和杏目一战。\n……就是这个意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18ac3b5ed216df3cf20d3b3eb77138fe3bff29cf1df7a00ea72defeb3ac3ea70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
