      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――你知道吗？\n今天要出道的旺紫丁。\n听说连那位“暴君”都高看她一眼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07e33ec9993fc7cdc3f723399ccc9a493390a1f0994933a10d6bc56224b6b96f",
